                    "WRF360L"
                ]
            },
            "reason": "The variable emiss of the NARCliM datasets (UNSW, WRF360*) is the surface emissivity (cf_standard_name surface_emissivity, no units), while emiss in the CMIP5 CMOR tables is the emission of sea salt aerosol (kg m-2 s-1): excluded for now, as there is no variable of the KG for it."
